<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<ContentPage xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/dotnet/2021/maui"
             xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2009/xaml"
             x:Class="JustAnotherHemaClub.Views.LiabilityPage"
             Title="Liability statement">
    <ScrollView>
        <VerticalStackLayout Padding="20" Spacing="14">

            <Label Text="Liability statement" Style="{StaticResource H1}" />
            <Label Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Text="Last updated: 2025" />

            <!-- Language toggle -->
            <HorizontalStackLayout Spacing="8">
                <Button x:Name="EnglishButton" Text="English"
                        Clicked="OnEnglishClicked" />
                <Button x:Name="HungarianButton" Text="Magyar"
                        Style="{StaticResource SecondaryButton}"
                        Clicked="OnHungarianClicked" />
            </HorizontalStackLayout>

            <!-- English -->
            <VerticalStackLayout x:Name="EnglishSection" Spacing="10">
                <Label Text="English" Style="{StaticResource H2}" />
                <Label LineBreakMode="WordWrap">
                    <Label.Text>
Historical European Martial Arts (HEMA) training involves physical contact with weapons and
other participants. Injuries can occur even when proper equipment is worn and safety rules
are followed.

By checking the liability box on the registration / profile page you confirm that:

  - You participate in Club trainings, sparring and events voluntarily and at your own risk.
  - You are physically fit for vigorous physical activity, or you have consulted a doctor
    and accept the responsibility of doing so.
  - You will wear and maintain the protective equipment required for each activity.
  - You will follow the safety rules and the instructors' directions during every session.
  - Neither the Club, its instructors, nor other members are liable for injuries, loss or
    damage to property arising from your participation, except in cases of gross negligence
    or wilful misconduct.

I acknowledge that participating in training involves physical exertion and a potential
risk of injury. In order to protect my own physical integrity, I will use appropriate
protective equipment and will follow the instructor's directions at all times. Neither the
association nor the instructor is liable for injuries or accidents arising from my own
fault or risk-taking.

During practice and sparring I will do everything I can to protect my partner's and my own
physical integrity. I will observe the safety regulations and the rules for using equipment.
I take responsibility for the personal and borrowed equipment I use. Before each training
session I make sure that it can be used safely.

I am required to use borrowed equipment for its intended purpose and to compensate for any
damage caused to it that is not the result of intended use.

I declare that my state of health permits me to participate in training, and that I have
no illness or limitation that would, during participation in training, pose a danger to
myself or to others.

If you do not agree to these terms, please do not check the liability box and do not take
part in the Club's training activities.
                    </Label.Text>
                </Label>
            </VerticalStackLayout>

            <!-- Hungarian -->
            <VerticalStackLayout x:Name="HungarianSection" Spacing="10" IsVisible="False">
                <Label Text="Magyar" Style="{StaticResource H2}" />
                <Label LineBreakMode="WordWrap">
                    <Label.Text>
A felelossegvallalasi nyilatkozat bejelolesevel a regisztracios / profil oldalon az
alabbiakat ismered el:

  - A Klub edzesein, gyakorlasain es esemenyein onkentesen, sajat felelossegedre veszel reszt.
  - Fizikailag alkalmas vagy az intenziv testmozgasra, vagy orvossal konzultaltal es ezt a
    felelosseget vallalod.
  - Az adott tevekenyseghez eloirt vedofelszerelest viseled es karbantartod.
  - Minden alkalommal betartod a biztonsagi szabalyokat es az edzok utasitasait.
  - A Klubot, az edzoket es a tobbi tagot nem terheli felelosseg a reszveteledbol eredo
    serulesekert, kar- vagy vagyonveszteseger, kiveve sulyos gondatlansag vagy szandekos
    magatartas eseten.

Tudomasul veszem, hogy az edzesen valo reszvetel fizikai megterhelessel es potencialis
serulesveszellyel jar.
Sajat testi epsegem megovasa erdekeben megfelelo vedofelszerelest hasznalok, es az edzo
utasitasait minden esetben betartom. Az esetleges serulesekert, balesetekert, amelyek
sajat hibambol vagy kockazatvallalasbol erednek, az egyesuletet es az edzot nem terheli
felelosseg.

Gyakorlas es a parbajok soran mindent megteszek partnerem es a sajat testi epsegenek
megovasaert. Betartom a biztonsagi eloirasokat, az eszkozhasznalati szabalyokat.

Felelosseget vallalok az altalam hasznalt sajat es kolcsonzott felszerelesert, eszkozokert.
Edzes elott meggyozodok rola, hogy biztonsagosan hasznalhatok.

Koteles vagyok a kolcson kapott eszkozoket rendeltetesszeruen hasznalni, es azokban
keletkezett esetleges kart megteriteni, ha az nem rendeltetesszeru hasznalatbol ered.

Kijelentem, hogy egeszsegi allapotom lehetove teszi az edzesen valo reszvetelt, es nem all
fenn olyan betegsegem vagy korlatozottsagom, amely az edzeseken valo reszvetel soran ram
vagy masokra veszelyt jelentene.

Ha nem ertesz egyet ezekkel a feltetelekkel, kerjuk, ne jelold be a felelossegvallalasi
jelolonegyzetet es ne vegy reszt a Klub edzesein.
                    </Label.Text>
                </Label>
            </VerticalStackLayout>

        </VerticalStackLayout>
    </ScrollView>
</ContentPage>